   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "computeAllSources() keeps one row per pair with\nprotectedBy, the simplest method in the order ECMP →\nLFA → Remote LFA → TI-LFA (B20).",
