   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Coverage counts (destination, primary link) pairs and asks which method protects each. On the plain ring LFA gets 50% and Remote LFA lifts it to 100%; with one\nexpensive link LFA and Remote LFA drop to 40%, while TI-LFA stays at 100%.",
